        ]
      },
      {
        "input": "How can I prevent the empty state from flashing?",
        "output": "Define the derived state in PHP before rendering. Match the same condition in the client store so hydration preserves the initial markup."
      },
      {
        "input": "What should I change for WordPress 6.9?",
        "output": "Remove data-wp-ignore usage, assign unique directive identifiers where needed, and verify assumptions about server state across page transitions."
      }
